// Errors in exact and parametric mode that used to be crashes:
// * a property constant whose value cannot be computed (here, an integer
//   power with a negative exponent) gave a NullPointerException in the
//   exact/parametric model checker, rather than "Could not evaluate constant"
//   as for the other engines (see exact_param_errors.prism.props);
// * simulation (-sim) in parametric mode gave a ClassCastException, rather than
//   an error saying it is not supported, as in exact mode (see
//   exact_param_errors.prism.sim.props).

dtmc

const double p;

module m
	s : [0..2] init 0;
	[] s=0 -> p:(s'=1) + (1-p):(s'=2);
	[] s>0 -> true;
endmodule
